{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nJeW0Ts1QT1793800129.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國務院總理李強表示，中國願在全球知識產權治理中發揮更大作用。</p><p></p><p>李強在北京會見世界知識產權組織總幹事鄧鴻森。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.LI-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Rds8DU68NK1793799861.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>李強表示，當前世界經濟增長乏力，知識產權作為激勵創新、賦能發展的基本保障，其價值更加凸顯。中方願同世界知識產權組織繼續開展面向全球南方國家的合作，積極分享經驗，貢獻更多公共產品，讓知識產權發展成果惠及各方。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.LI-2300_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026P9TrHtZSPY1793800148.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T14:25:47.671139+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T13:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T17:18:16.588126+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T14:18:32.118356+00:00","content_hash":"0ac6c933c0f5eb9d79d7939cf7c37ac87c2f7386410e658a7bfd2a595ef1cb71","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T14:25:47.671139+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}